# Code owners for peristyle-ai/webmail.
#
# One owner: the Peristyle account (Grove). A pull request that changes
# anything needs an approval from this account before it can merge, and
# main does not accept direct pushes.
#
# WHY THIS IS THE ONLY LINE: the agents propose changes through pull
# requests opened by a GitHub Actions workflow using the repository's own
# GITHUB_TOKEN -- so the PR author is `github-actions[bot]`, NOT the
# Peristyle account. The bot cannot approve its own pull request, and it
# is not a code owner, so an agent's pull request can only ever be
# approved and merged by Grove.
* @peristyle-ai
